  "question": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{A}=\\{1,2,3,4\\}, \\mathrm{B}=\\{1,2,3,4,5,6\\}$ are two sets, and function $\\mathrm{f}: \\mathrm{A} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{B}$ is defined by $\\mathrm{f}(\\mathrm{x})=\\mathrm{x}+2 \\forall \\mathrm{x} \\in \\mathrm{A}$, then the function $\\mathrm{f}$ is",
    "image": null
  },
